LDA [NO:  GET THE COUNTER
3
SROi [LAST DIGIT?
3567
JMP ** [NO:  BACK TO THE SUBROUTINE
STHi1 [YES: STORE IT
#A28P   JMP ** [    AND RETURN TO CALLING PGM
[ADDEND TABLE
#A28Q   1750
