[  ERROR RETURN
[  NORMAL RETURN
[
[IR1 MUST BE SET JUST BEFORE THE FIRST CH
[  DECBIN 1 LOOKS AT 5 CHARACTERS
[  USES IR1-4
[       TAGS 9A-9G
[  INTERRUPTABLE
[
[TIMING- CLASSIC LINC
[        0.7 - 2.1 MSEC
